IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CRD0023.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-INPUT.
    COPY CRD0023C.
01 OUT-RECORD.
    05 APPL-DECISION      PIC X VALUE 'D'.
    05 REASON-CODE        PIC X(3) VALUE SPACES.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAINLINE.
    ACCEPT WS-INPUT
    PERFORM PRIOR-BK-SCREEN
    DISPLAY "APPL-DECISION=" APPL-DECISION
    DISPLAY "REASON-CODE=" REASON-CODE
    STOP RUN.
PRIOR-BK-SCREEN.
    IF BANKRUPTCY-FLAG = 'Y'
        EVALUATE TRUE
            WHEN BK-YEARS < 5
                MOVE 'D' TO APPL-DECISION
                MOVE 'BK1' TO REASON-CODE
            WHEN OTHER
                MOVE 'R' TO APPL-DECISION
                MOVE 'BK2' TO REASON-CODE
        END-EVALUATE
    END-IF.
